msgid ""
"A analysis of rabbinic discussions of Gehinnom, the Jewish afterlife for the "
"cleansing of sins, including how big it is, how hot it is, who goes there, "
"how long they stay there, whether there is any relief from their punishments "
"in the meantime, and exactly what shape Gehinnom is."
msgstr ""
